  "summary_en": "Editorial introducing a Connection Science special issue revisiting the 2011 EPSRC/AHRC Principles of Robotics. It describes the 2016 AISB workshop assessing their validity, sufficiency and utility, and argues for amending the Principles through an inclusive process and engaging the public amid wider societal concern about robotics and AI.",
